# Gradle project additions
**/build/
# libs/ (jars + aars + local Maven repo) is committed to git since 2026-08-12
# so a fresh clone builds without regenerating AOSP artifacts.
!libs/
!libs/**/*.jar
!libs/**/*.aar
!libs/**/*.pom
!libs/**/*.module
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
res-gradle/

